What's Under Me uses these works by other people.

fonts/     Zilla Slab, from the npm package @fontsource/zilla-slab 5.3.0.
           SIL Open Font License 1.1; see fonts/OFL.txt.

The map uses the copy of MapLibre GL JS in ../planes/maplibre (BSD 3-Clause).

Data, fetched when the app runs and not stored in this repository, except that
a device keeps its last three spots for quicker reopening:

Geology     Macrostrat, https://macrostrat.org, CC BY 4.0, and the geological
            surveys whose maps it brings together.
Fossils     The Paleobiology Database, https://paleobiodb.org, CC BY 4.0.
Plate       The GPlates Web Service, https://www.gplates.org, using the
motions     Merdith et al. 2021 plate model.
Base map    OpenFreeMap (https://openfreemap.org) with tiles from OpenMapTiles
            (https://openmaptiles.org) and data from OpenStreetMap contributors
            (ODbL).

The explanations in geology.js were written for this app. Period ages and
colors follow the International Chronostratigraphic Chart.
